classifier.tsv (the Data Map classifier file) contains data from these sources, and is itself licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/):

- AdGuard Companies DB, https://github.com/AdguardTeam/companiesdb, CC BY-SA 4.0. It lists tracker domains, the
  companies behind them and categories. It was built on the whotracks.me database (Ghostery, CC BY 4.0,
  https://github.com/ghostery/whotracks.me). The commit used is named in the first source record of the file.
  Changes: only the categories that this file uses were kept (advertising, analytics, social, cdn, core), and
  the company of a domain was reduced to its owner record.
- Wikidata, https://www.wikidata.org/, CC0 1.0: the headquarters location of a company and the coordinates of
  its city.
- Facts taken from company filings, company documentation and public registers, each with its own source record.
  Facts are not copied text.
